  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chocoa Event 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to gain insights into the new economic resilience studies from ETG, Beyond Beans, and RVO during Chocoa Amsterdam Week. This event will foster discussions and partnerships between Dutch and local stakeholders (private companies, NGOs, RVO, Embassies), focusing on strengthening economic resilience within the cocoa sectors of both C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire and Ghana.Building on last year&#x2019;s event, this year will delve deeper into the lessons learned and results from the past year. The central theme will be contributing to a living income for cocoa farmers.Ultimately, the project aims to support the sustainable development of the cocoa sector in both C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire and Ghana, identifying opportunities for local processing, youth employment, and business prospects for Dutch products and services that can drive this growth.</narrative>
  </description>
